}} \ensuremath{\partial_{\gamma}}^n \ensuremath{\left(\nu_0\right)}_{\mid_{\gamma=0}}  \right\}} \ensuremath{\sum\limits_{\sigma=\pm }^{}} {\ensuremath{ 
    \mathchoice 
    {\dfrac{1}{N}}
