    {\frac{I_n^{ \ensuremath{\left(N;m\right)} }\ensuremath{\left[\ensuremath{\mathcal{F}}_n\right]}}{x^{N}}}
}}= x^{-2}\ensuremath{\mathcal{W}}^{\ensuremath{\left(m\right)}}\ensuremath{\ensuremath{\mathrm{e}}^{x \ensuremath{\mathcal{G}}^{\ensuremath{\left(m\right)}} + \ln x \ensuremath{\mathcal{H}}^{\ensuremath{\left(m\right)}} }}  \ensuremath{\sum\limits_{k=0}^{N}} \ensuremath{\left({\ensuremath{ 
