\ensuremath{\partial_{\gamma}}^n \ensuremath{\widetilde{O}}_{N,\, k}\ensuremath{\left[\sigma \nu^{\ensuremath{\left(m\right)}}\right]}_{\mid_{\gamma=0} }  \; +  \; \ensuremath{\mathrm{o}}\ensuremath{\left(x^{-2}\right)} \\


